<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenian March c/a deficit widens to $58 mln.</title>
<headline>Slovenian March c/a deficit widens to $58 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Tuesday.</p>
<p>CURRENT ACCOUNT BALANCE (in million of dollars)</p>
<p>				    March	  Feb	  March 96</p>
<p>Current account balance     -58.0	 -22.0	 -56.3</p>
<p>Merchandise trade balance   -155	   -94	   -134</p>
<p>Exports			    670	   638	    730</p>
<p>Imports			    825	   732	    865</p>
<p>(Differences due to rounding)</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
